<title>USA: Commodore Applied names vice chairman.</title>
<headline>Commodore Applied names vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commodore Applied Technologies Inc said on Tuesday it named Edwin Harper as a director and vice chairman of the company's board.</p>
<p>Harper has been president of the Association of American Railroads for the past five years, the company said.</p>
<p>Previously, he was with Campbell Soup Co for five years as chief financial officer. He served as Campbell's co-chief executive in late 1989 and early 1990.</p>
</text>
